From f2e062a38a16bd882fe36eab5f3c46cbecc25903 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 02:31:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add weekly AI review and native launcher for the Onitry
 Plan extension

- /v1/review on the browser bridge: the extension posts a week of planner
  stats and Onitry writes a short review with Claude (ai/review.py) on its
  own API key, so the extension never holds one. REVIEW_MODEL is
  configurable via ONITRY_REVIEW_MODEL; refusals and API errors come back
  as a 503 with a readable reason.
- native_host/: a Chrome native-messaging host (com.onitry.host) so the
  extension can launch Onitry when a focus block starts and it isn't
  running, plus install.py to register it for Chrome/Chromium/Brave/Edge/Arc
  (registry on Windows), locked to the extension's fixed ID.
- BRIDGE.md documents both; tests for the route, the review call and the
  host protocol/installer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017S59sqjwDK29HVsHNDbRhc
